    "Reuse identity-verified market routing and price grid only for authorized HARD_STOP sells; cache expires at close or after 900 seconds, is bounded to 256 entries, and is invalidated on rejected orders or failed metadata refresh. Fresh holdings, reduce-only IOC, journal, and final authorization remain.",
